                "HSE Integrated Risk Management Policy - Part 2/HSE Incident Management Framework/HSE Incident Management Framework - Guidance 2020" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition>
                "An event or circumstance which could have, or did, lead to unintended and/or unnecessary harm. Incidents include adverse events which result in harm; near-misses which could have resulted in harm, but did not cause harm, either by chance or timely intervention; and staff or service user complaints which are associated with harm." ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme>
                <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower>
