        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition>
                "The giving of permission or agreement for an intervention, receipt or use of a service or participation in research following a process of communication in which the service user has received sufficient information to enable them to understand the nature, potential risks and benefits of the proposed intervention or service" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme>
                <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note>
                "HIQA National Standards for the Prevention and Control of Healthcare-Associated Infections 2017" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel>
                "Informed Consent" .

