                "A clinical specialty that focuses on the study of human diseases caused by micro-organisms including bacteria, viruses, fungi and parasites" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme>
                <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#> ;
