                <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#DiagnosticMicrobiologyLaboratory> , <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ConsultantMedicalMicrobiologist> , <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#MicrobiologicalServices> ;
